  "caveat": "FRED publicly displays a BLS-origin producer price index for all truck transportation PCU484484, Dec 2003=100, not seasonally adjusted; the 2017–2024 monthly values shown here were transcribed from the FRED public data table and are NOT freshly replayed from FRED HTTP inside GitHub CI. Both direct FRED endpoints timed out in that runner. The original BLS API v1 rejected PCU484484 while returning child truckload and LTL indexes, so data provenance is weaker than the BLS-authenticated two child series in Mission 26. A parent 484 price-adjusted revenue change calculated using the FRED snapshot is at most a provisional, illustrative index-adjusted Census revenue proxy, not official real output, freight volume, invoice overcharge rate, collected recovery cash, customer market size or independent survey evidence. Direct FRED/BLS replay and source revision monitoring remain unverified; all 18 real-customer pilot controls remain unmet."
